    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Users Birthday Email plugin automatically send an email to WordPress users on their birthday.</p>\n<p>This is very easy to use and user friendly interface for non technical person.</p>\n<p>It provides a date-picker to collect the user&#8217;s birthday data. Also you can integrate it with any kind of membership plugin.</p>\n<p>Users Birthday Email plugin gives you many filter hooks so that you can modify it easily.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>MODERN WAY:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Go to the WordPress Dashboard “Add New Plugin” section.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Search For “Users Birthday Email”.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Install, then Activate it.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>OLD WAY:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Upload the plugin folder to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Activate the plugin through the ‘Plugins’ menu in WordPress.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20this%20work%20without%20the%20membership%20plugin%3F'>\nDoes this work without the membership plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it does not require any membership plugin to use. Because it provides a date-picker to collect the user&#8217;s birthday data.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20this%20plugin%20work%20with%20any%20membership%20plugin%20data%3F'>\nCan this plugin work with any membership plugin data?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it can work with any membership plugin data. Because this plugin has many filter hooks that can be easily integrated with other membership plugins.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.7 &#8211; 2025-01-02</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Not sending email issue</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6 &#8211; 2024-05-22</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Update user birthday meta</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5 &#8211; 2024-04-22</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Docs url added</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4 &#8211; 2024-04-22</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Shortcode field added &amp; hooks modified</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3 &#8211; 2024-02-18</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Missing placeholder image</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2 &#8211; 2024-02-18</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Add plugin images with placeholder image</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1 &#8211; 2024-02-11</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Missing placeholder image</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0 &#8211; 2024-02-09</h4>\n<p>Initial Release</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Users Birthday Email plugin automatically send an email to WordPress users on their birthday.",
    "description": "<p>Users Birthday Email plugin automatically send an email to WordPress users on their birthday.</p>\n<p>This is very easy to use and user friendly interface for non technical person.</p>\n<p>It provides a date-picker to collect the user&#8217;s birthday data. Also you can integrate it with any kind of membership plugin.</p>\n<p>Users Birthday Email plugin gives you many filter hooks so that you can modify it easily.</p>\n",
